{"seq":1,"slug":"why-virtualization","title":"为何虚拟化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/foundations/why-virtualization","wordCount":1544,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何虚拟化\">为何虚拟化</h1><p>打开浏览器开发者工具，往一个 <code>&lt;ul&gt;</code> 里塞进五万个 <code>&lt;li&gt;</code>，再拖动滚动条——你会立刻感受到主线程的窒息：滚动卡成幻灯片，标签页内存涨到几百兆，连点击都要等上一秒。问题不在数据本身，三百万个字符串对现代 CPU 不值一提；问题在于你逼着浏览器为每一条数据都造了一个 DOM 节点，而 DOM 节点是整个 Web 平台里最昂贵的对象之一。虚拟化要解决的，正是「节点数随数据线性膨胀」这一根本矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一个-dom-节点到底贵在哪\">核心概念：一个 DOM 节点到底贵在哪</h2><p>把数据交给浏览器渲染，要经过一条流水线：解析生成 DOM、计算每个节点的样式、布局算出几何位置、绘制成位图、再合成上屏。这条管线的每一步成本都与参与的节点数成正比。一个节点的代价至少包含四笔账：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>内存</strong>：每个元素节点在主流引擎里占用数百字节到上千字节，叠加它的样式对象、布局对象、可能的事件监听器与框架包装对象（React Fiber、Vue VNode）。五万行很容易吃掉上百兆。</li>\n<li><strong>样式计算</strong>：浏览器要为每个节点匹配 CSS 规则、解析继承与层叠，节点越多，一次 recalc style 越慢。</li>\n<li><strong>布局（layout/reflow）</strong>：把节点放进盒模型、算出每个的位置与尺寸，是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 量级的工作，长列表里一次布局就要遍历全部行。</li>\n<li><strong>绘制与合成</strong>：即便离屏不可见，节点仍参与布局，且首次构建时都要走一遍。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四笔账里，布局与样式计算的原理由渲染内部 hub 主讲，本篇只取「成本与节点数成正比」这一个结论。深究 reflow 与 repaint 的触发与代价，见 <a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/performance/reflow-repaint-cost\">重排与重绘的代价</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把成本写成模型\">把成本写成模型</h2><p>设可见区能容纳的行数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，数据总行数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。全量渲染时，DOM 节点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_\\text{full} = n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，渲染与内存成本近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_\\text{full} = k \\cdot n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是每行的单位成本）。虚拟化后，任意时刻只渲染窗口内的行，节点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>virt</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_\\text{virt} \\approx v + 2b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">virt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 是上下各预渲染的过扫描行数），成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>virt</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_\\text{virt} = k \\cdot (v + 2b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">virt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 无关。</p>\n<p>二者之比就是虚拟化的收益：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>virt</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{C_\\text{full}}{C_\\text{virt}} = \\frac{n}{v + 2b}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">virt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8769em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 50000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50000</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b = 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 时，这个比值约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1667</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1667</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1667</span></span></span></span></span>——意味着浏览器要做的渲染工作压缩到了原来的约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.06</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.06\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.06%</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，收益越夸张，而虚拟化的成本始终被钉在常数级。这正是虚拟化值得存在的数学理由：它把一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的渲染问题变成了 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>下面这张表把三种规模下的实测量级感受具象化（数量级估算，实际随设备与行复杂度浮动）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据行数</th>\n<th>全量 DOM 节点</th>\n<th>全量首次渲染量级</th>\n<th>虚拟化 DOM 节点</th>\n<th>虚拟化渲染量级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>&lt; 16 ms（流畅）</td>\n<td>~30</td>\n<td>&lt; 16 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5,000</td>\n<td>5,000</td>\n<td>数百 ms（卡顿）</td>\n<td>~30</td>\n<td>&lt; 16 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50,000</td>\n<td>50,000</td>\n<td>数秒 + 内存告警</td>\n<td>~30</td>\n<td>&lt; 16 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1,000,000</td>\n<td>浏览器近乎假死</td>\n<td>不可用</td>\n<td>~30</td>\n<td>&lt; 16 ms</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"它如何破局-只渲染看得见的\">它如何破局：只渲染看得见的</h2><p>虚拟化的核心动作是「拒绝渲染不可见的行」。它维持一个高度等于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 行总高的滚动容器（让滚动条长度正确），但容器里实际只放窗口内那几十个真实节点，并用绝对定位或 transform 把它们摆到对应的滚动位置。用户滚动时，窗口跟着移动，旧行被回收、新行被渲染——DOM 里始终只有常数个节点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[数据:n 行,可能上万] --&gt; B{当前滚动位置 scrollTop}&#10;  B --&gt; C[计算可见区覆盖的索引区间]&#10;  C --&gt; D[加上过扫描:上下各 b 行]&#10;  D --&gt; E[只渲染该区间的真实 DOM 节点]&#10;  E --&gt; F[用偏移把节点摆到正确位置]&#10;  F --&gt; G[容器总高 = n × 行高,滚动条长度正确]&#10;  B -.滚动时重算.-&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n  A[数据:n 行,可能上万] --&gt; B{当前滚动位置 scrollTop}\n  B --&gt; C[计算可见区覆盖的索引区间]\n  C --&gt; D[加上过扫描:上下各 b 行]\n  D --&gt; E[只渲染该区间的真实 DOM 节点]\n  E --&gt; F[用偏移把节点摆到正确位置]\n  F --&gt; G[容器总高 = n × 行高,滚动条长度正确]\n  B -.滚动时重算.-&gt; C</pre><p>这套机制的几何细节——窗口怎么切、偏移怎么算、过扫描取多少——是后面几篇的主题。本篇只确立一件事：<strong>虚拟化用「常数个节点」替换「线性个节点」，从根上掐断了长列表的成本增长</strong>。其抽象模型见 <a href=\"windowing-model\">窗口化模型</a>，可见区的具体计算见 <a href=\"viewport-overscan\">可见区与过扫描</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么时候不该虚拟化\">什么时候不该虚拟化</h2><p>虚拟化不是免费的，它有自己的代价：实现复杂度、滚动时的重渲染开销、对可访问性与浏览器内查找的破坏（见 <a href=\"../practice/virtualization-pitfalls\">虚拟化陷阱</a>）。下面是几条「别急着上虚拟化」的判断线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>行数稳定在几百以内</strong>：现代浏览器渲染几百个简单节点毫无压力，虚拟化带来的复杂度得不偿失。</li>\n<li><strong>每行结构极简且数量中等</strong>：纯文本短行即使上千，配合 CSS <code>content-visibility</code> 这种「零 JS 虚拟化」就够了，不必引入完整库——这一替代方案见 <a href=\"../practice/virtualization-libraries\">虚拟化库选型</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>需要被浏览器内查找、SEO 抓取、或整页打印</strong>：被卸载的行对这些场景不可见，可能弊大于利。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个实用的经验阈值是：当行数稳定超过约一两千、或单行结构复杂（含图片/富文本/嵌套组件）时，虚拟化的收益才开始压过它的复杂度成本。判断之前，先用真实数据量做一次性能剖析，别凭感觉。性能剖析的方法见 <a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/foundations/measurement-rum\">测量与剖析工具</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>长列表卡顿的根源是 DOM 节点数随数据线性增长，每个节点都在内存、样式、布局、绘制四个维度上持续收费。</li>\n<li>全量渲染成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_\\text{full} = k \\cdot n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，虚拟化成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>virt</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_\\text{virt} = k \\cdot (v + 2b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">virt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 无关，收益比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n / (v + 2b)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在万级数据上可达千倍。</li>\n<li>虚拟化的核心是只渲染可见窗口内的常数个节点，用等高容器保证滚动条正确，用偏移摆放节点。</li>\n<li>它有复杂度与可访问性代价，行数稳定在几百以内、或需要浏览器查找/SEO/打印时应慎用，决策前先做性能剖析。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>下一步理解抽象：<a href=\"windowing-model\">窗口化模型</a>、<a href=\"viewport-overscan\">可见区与过扫描</a></li>\n<li>不该虚拟化时的替代：<a href=\"../practice/virtualization-libraries\">虚拟化库选型</a></li>\n<li>跨库——渲染成本原理：<a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/performance/reflow-repaint-cost\">重排与重绘的代价</a></li>\n<li>跨库——先量再优化：<a href=\"../../web-performance-vitals/foundations/measurement-rum\">Core Web Vitals 测量与 RUM</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何虚拟化","id":"为何虚拟化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一个 DOM 节点到底贵在哪","id":"核心概念-一个-dom-节点到底贵在哪"},{"level":2,"text":"把成本写成模型","id":"把成本写成模型"},{"level":2,"text":"它如何破局：只渲染看得见的","id":"它如何破局-只渲染看得见的"},{"level":2,"text":"什么时候不该虚拟化","id":"什么时候不该虚拟化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"窗口化模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/foundations/windowing-model"}}